# Revised Sustainable Fashion Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As a fashion designer and advocate for sustainability, I have been researching ways to reduce the environmental impact of my designs. This revised research plan builds upon previous work by incorporating emerging trends in sustainable fashion and exploring potential partnerships with companies prioritizing sustainability.<br>
<br>
### Emerging Trends in Sustainable Fashion<br>
<br>
*   Circular business models<br>
*   Biodegradable materials<br>
*   Digital printing technologies<br>
<br>
